{"name": "Fool King", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/f32b8d0f7fd70713ac974b8a0d4658a5.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"569\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/f32b8d0f7fd70713ac974b8a0d4658a5.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span>To rule over the wartorn world of The Everdawn, you must carve your way through the armies of past players and defeat the immortal Fool King. Create an unstoppable army by combining unique units, potent upgrades, powerful relics, and your tactical genius to take the title of Fool King for yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan, battle, fall, repeat! Do what it takes until your quest is complete. Once you take the throne, impose your will on other players with powerful decrees that change the rules of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/bf1d1726f5013d77d4b1ec820d3f0fff.poster.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/bf1d1726f5013d77d4b1ec820d3f0fff.webm?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/bf1d1726f5013d77d4b1ec820d3f0fff.mp4?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/82a4eeef332350b8b53930e1d1261b08.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/82a4eeef332350b8b53930e1d1261b08.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage a host of unique units across three distinct factions, each with their own specialities and role on the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From explosive mages and blood-thirsty barbarians, devious goblin boxlings and long-throwing catapults, to demonic brutes and cultists \u2013 each army has its own strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/178c7d36f23d81560dfcb8fa91f61af2.poster.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/178c7d36f23d81560dfcb8fa91f61af2.webm?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/178c7d36f23d81560dfcb8fa91f61af2.mp4?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/4f85ff7b1c2a3a315f7aa8eca0c0f22a.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/4f85ff7b1c2a3a315f7aa8eca0c0f22a.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gods control unspeakable powers, and your troops can wield them. Imbue your army with their otherworldly strength and explore new, exciting synergies. Whether you rely on the putrid abilities of Bognor or the rageful might of T\u00e2n-ark, mix and match the four godly playstyles to expand your strategic possibilities with over 120 upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/cf342f81a88af238e236c9ae7a930809.poster.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/cf342f81a88af238e236c9ae7a930809.webm?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/cf342f81a88af238e236c9ae7a930809.mp4?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/f690b16f450cfb031f6d0dda67e7c4db.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/f690b16f450cfb031f6d0dda67e7c4db.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the enemy in sight, put your inner general to the test. Use the terrain to your advantage over a variety of biomes, each with multiple maps. Whether it is the choke points of the Blood Swamps or the long grass of the Unclaimed Lands, each has unique features for you to exploit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully place your troops, issue your commands and watch the battle unfold! When strength is matched, planning and preparation is key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/9aecb5b0e357fd4ee45dcc34c1d7a2b7.poster.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/9aecb5b0e357fd4ee45dcc34c1d7a2b7.webm?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/9aecb5b0e357fd4ee45dcc34c1d7a2b7.mp4?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/9200ef46bb1c0ebd6065104c5608e4c9.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/9200ef46bb1c0ebd6065104c5608e4c9.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The road to the Black Citadel hosts the phantoms of players that came before. In each run, stack your skills and strategies against those who dared to try their hand at the throne. Prove yourself worthy against their forces, upgrades and tactics to succeed where they could not!<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/d710162072b725f4a51bafcde9ea7679.poster.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/d710162072b725f4a51bafcde9ea7679.webm?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/d710162072b725f4a51bafcde9ea7679.mp4?t=1788868839\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/09236cce6f0f04ca25f8498359adf6e8.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"264\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/09236cce6f0f04ca25f8498359adf6e8.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/7b72e80ab8fbceee35cfa75ea6f97c5b.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"163\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/7b72e80ab8fbceee35cfa75ea6f97c5b.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The path to the Fool King is one beset by danger and opportunities! Early Access will allow us to craft and expand upon the world and lore of The Everdawn with more gods, units, biomes and upgrades. Join us and help shape this grand journey today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/1e670ab2bf37c326534921031f8195eb.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"569\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/1e670ab2bf37c326534921031f8195eb.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RULE THE EVERDAWN</strong> by dethroning the Fool King and becoming the final boss for all other challengers in the realm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TAKE THE THRONE </strong>and choose rule-breaking decrees that affect other challengers' attempts at glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SHATTER THE ARMIES OF FALLEN PLAYERS</strong> and unleash devastating attacks based on smart strategy and careful battlefield tactics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEAST YOUR EYES</strong> on the environments and denizens of The Everdawn, all of it brought to life in a vivid, punchy hand-drawn artstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAKE YOUR CHOICES COUNT</strong> by selecting and merging a variety of unit types, bolstering their power with a huge selection of upgrades and relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRUST IN YOUR TACTICS</strong> by placing your troops, setting their formations and initial commands to squeeze every advantage from the environment in order to claim victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras_big/84643be1f63f0a9027aebb4e7f80b978.webp?t=1788868839\" height=\"284\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/extras/84643be1f63f0a9027aebb4e7f80b978.avif?t=1788868839\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dethrone the Fool King in this tactical autobattler with asynchronous PvP! Amass your troops, apply powerful upgrades and set your battle formations. Watch your plans come together or fall apart in frantic simulated combat.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4380860/2b2bf513881ab8fe87e2ce9f0cbf52da4c1b7595/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1788868839", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Asynchronous Multiplayer", "Roguelike", "Wargame", "Strategy", "PvP"], "developers": "Loot Donkey", "publishers": "Loot Donkey", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4380860", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Z538DQOElp8", "first_seen": 1788732000.0, "review_rank": 27}